399 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Before switches, early networks used hubs, which flooded all connected devices with every incoming data packet. This caused network congestion and security risks. Switches solve this problem by intelligently forwarding packets only to the intended recipient, improving efficiency and performance.)
